# State keywords with a target (v0.3): "Check: Remember me" is about the target "Remember me" of
# the element, "Check" alone about the element itself. Enable / Disable accept a target too.
Screen: Login

  Element: Login Form
    Show: Remember me
    Editable: Email address

    When: The form is empty
    Uncheck: Remember me
    Empty: Email address
    Disable: Login button
    Focus: Email address

    When: Input is valid
    Enable: Login button

    When: Remembered
    Check: Remember me
